      "content": "i get that, but like, i've done caffeine before and i'm usually fine. i'm mostly just worried about the focus part. if i take like two 200mg caffeine pills in the morning when i take my ritalin, will that actually give me that extra edge i need for studying? seems like a lot of people do some kind of combo to stay sharp.",
